@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
!include style.puml
skinparam ArrowFontStyle plain
skinparam state {
    BackgroundColor MODEL_COLOR
    BorderColor MODEL_COLOR_T3
    FontColor USER_COLOR
}
hide empty description

[*] --> AllMembers

state "AllMembers\n(no active conditions)" as AllMembers
state "Narrowed\n(one or more conditions)" as Narrowed

AllMembers --> Narrowed : find / filter / show / findemail
Narrowed --> AllMembers : remove last chip
Narrowed --> AllMembers : list, successful add,\nsuccessful clear /all, valid import
Narrowed --> Narrowed : add or remove a condition

note left of Narrowed
All conditions combine with AND.
A repeated tag or identical show
selection adds no new condition.
end note

note right of AllMembers
sort, delete and displayed clear
retain the active conditions.
list preserves stored order.
end note
@enduml
